# Keeps this directory in the repository so the Docker build can COPY it even
# when no model has been trained.
#
# Trained artefacts (eta*.onnx, features.json) are git-ignored: they are build
# outputs, they are binary, and a model committed here would be served in
# production by whoever deployed next without anyone deciding to. Train one with
# ml/train.py and mount or bake it in deliberately.
